      {
        "block_id": "block_000033",
        "block_index": 33,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Best Postpartum Belly Band for C-section Recovery",
        "text_sha256": "8feb062501ea25cffc426d2f8ca99d1506a8c2ef31a44d2c3558c46d7a4ecee7",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000034",
        "block_index": 34,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Belly Bandit Postpartum Luxe Belly Wrap",
        "text_sha256": "6d568d1ba3f3c668ea37b228d2da6c5ca1aa3e3df77435aeb69f2629f81f97e2",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000035",
        "block_index": 35,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Great support",
        "text_sha256": "e02a2723412e380ff449463b4f90dc35139d42a9458577ce18d1a6078633cabc",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000036",
        "block_index": 36,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "comfortable even for C-section recovery",
        "text_sha256": "c7a96dd9616579e9957c2d885ed75693c89426ab62958b3c24259c52a90955db",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000037",
        "block_index": 37,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Expensive",
        "text_sha256": "7c6d1152f8cb2894e4bbbc2050cf3a8fdafc9374473227ae4d7f0853439c3c06",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000038",
        "block_index": 38,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Why We Love It",
        "text_sha256": "6e31e7604a2268d00ddf2594453e493aef84f8dd297f3a72433e60834fa4117b",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you’re recovering from a C-section, you might appreciate the extra support and compression offered by the Belly Bandit Postpartum Luxe Belly Wrap . The best-selling product is made of a silky-soft nylon/Spandex combo that compresses and supports your core muscles without causing any discomfort — an especially attractive feature for those recovering from a C-section. (Just remember not to wear it until at least 2 weeks after your C-section, and with your doctor's sign off.)",
        "text_sha256": "bb43b8cb99f45f3602189b7d8415d962b0fdb82ce8ccd52958f693a1ef660e00",
        "word_count": 76
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000040",
        "block_index": 40,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The Velcro fasteners ensure that you can continue adjusting the band’s fit as your body changes postpartum. The band also comes in a regular size and petite size to ensure that people of all heights can get full stomach and back coverage from the band. However, it’s the most costly postpartum belly band on this list, and some folks might balk at shelling out that much money for something that’s only worn for a few months at a time.",
        "text_sha256": "a63cd4f5762a32c5c7d6c8aef0d1852d9bb10eb5d4247fa369fedd563c752a49",
        "word_count": 79
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000041",
        "block_index": 41,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Sizes : XS through XL, to fit postpartum stomach sizes up to 57 inches. All sizes come in a regular fit (with a front height of 11 inches and back height of 12 inches) or petite (front height of 9 inches and back height of 10 inches).",
        "text_sha256": "4e3e5fa31756eb62522303ffc9d79fa67a594694b23800cfbdf0f1d6376debad",
        "word_count": 47
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000042",
        "block_index": 42,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Community Reviews",
        "text_sha256": "465413c7bb1d61dee5f0f9c88203d57ba9924778bb8dd741cd5a68205136ddcc",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000043",
        "block_index": 43,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "TwinMamaLove I very much prefer the Luxe even only being 5’2”. More comfortable, doesn’t ride up, and doesn’t make me look like I have back fat. I had 4 cm diastasis recti after and an abdominal binder was recommended to me while I was in PT. I felt a lot more comfortable with it on.",
        "text_sha256": "08107d643778a02dbe4f84ed0808d169bccf940f8b7465c31c74f14c8f88d3fd",
        "word_count": 55
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000044",
        "block_index": 44,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Best Adjustable Postpartum Belly Band",
        "text_sha256": "135e80eab9feab3517542b1ae0e0ff95081a31862ea7407a7ceb94b081dc9d89",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000045",
        "block_index": 45,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Belly Bandit B.F.F. Belly Wrap",
        "text_sha256": "2f0a76b0914b00a6172c329e23928dca388c92e00fc94636433c0175f7d1a7c6",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000046",
        "block_index": 46,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Specifically designed to be worn postpartum",
        "text_sha256": "6f76468146656a602a5af28ec91ca3268d5a92085cc46d67d7e2ff522928315c",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000047",
        "block_index": 47,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "including for moms who’ve had a C-section",
        "text_sha256": "6a5f6b4829cf405984879f6abf01a7cecc44655ad0b25a13ae0f87ebb1f39012",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000048",
        "block_index": 48,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Some moms found it too tight and uncomfortable",
        "text_sha256": "9cb96712744ae346505979eeea2ae88aa513b57a080f8e5d0f51578aeee3d820",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000049",
        "block_index": 49,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Why We Love It",
        "text_sha256": "6e31e7604a2268d00ddf2594453e493aef84f8dd297f3a72433e60834fa4117b",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000050",
        "block_index": 50,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Some belly bands are loved for their simplicity — but the Belly Bandit B.F.F. Belly Wrap is versatility at its best. Made with six support panels — including two customizable compression panels — the wrap hugs you just like a “best friend forever.” It also has up to 9 inches of adjustable fabric so you can continue to adjust the fit as your body changes postpartum.",
        "text_sha256": "85cd7bf43088ac26a22eea170d2288dcb11f0cab73000f3d70d27fc9ba6d63f9",
        "word_count": 66
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000051",
        "block_index": 51,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Sizes : XS through XL, to fit postpartum stomach sizes up to 57 inches",
        "text_sha256": "4b0fa299508d9683c52fc16740ea672b06ba3120144e83f4edcc6c68f71e5574",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000052",
        "block_index": 52,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Community Reviews",
        "text_sha256": "465413c7bb1d61dee5f0f9c88203d57ba9924778bb8dd741cd5a68205136ddcc",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000053",
        "block_index": 53,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "cbpeterson I loved my belly bandit...I really liked the back support. My low back was in pain after birth so that helped a lot.",
        "text_sha256": "f133e6857156d7314a6ca416c168e920ad481dfca0de54443f1c387439a8b44f",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000054",
        "block_index": 54,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Best Postpartum Belly Band with Adjustable Compression",
        "text_sha256": "6c5a6dd2f5914174d78cba84d513191f9af2991d2468720af755bacec6898e93",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000055",
        "block_index": 55,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "TiRain 3-in-1 Postpartum Belly Support",
        "text_sha256": "1b67f5ae54cd5981d83ebc8ee3c45478a59f75dcee5804ffd4e629f42b0c50fd",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000056",
        "block_index": 56,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "More affordable than other options on the market",
        "text_sha256": "7d31187ff9c72cc9dac67afff8e6143f7367a8ac756288530fbc759148379e0b",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000057",
        "block_index": 57,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Some users say that it’s a little bulky under clothing",
        "text_sha256": "b154b8a38c36ed165889c5635be4786834e1be582d7ecb9c08252473eefa1e63",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000058",
        "block_index": 58,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Why We Love It",
        "text_sha256": "6e31e7604a2268d00ddf2594453e493aef84f8dd297f3a72433e60834fa4117b",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000059",
        "block_index": 59,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "New moms rave about the TiRain 3-in-1 Postpartum Support Belt , which comes with three bands that can be adjusted with Velcro straps to provide just the right amount of compression — more than most options on the market. While bulkier than some of the other styles (the belly band wraps around your stomach, the waist belt fits around your waistline and the pelvis belt sits on your hips), there’s no denying that, unlike some wraps, the TiRain 3-in-1 will stay put.",
        "text_sha256": "6bef6c32c95851d4b06fe6659d7f49183a8b12fd68854aa5ff2d287309585ab3",
        "word_count": 82
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000060",
        "block_index": 60,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Sizes : Size F fits stomachs that are 26-36.7 inches, waistlines that are 26-39 inches, and hips that are 32.7-42 inches. Size Plus is designed for stomachs that are 35-40 inches, waists that are 38-44 inches, and hips that are 40-46 inches.",
        "text_sha256": "b4d34b73d05ff4393e1188c3ec688d5002a0c50584aa0a664c0eae2e3b1dd794",
        "word_count": 42
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000061",
        "block_index": 61,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Community Reviews",
        "text_sha256": "465413c7bb1d61dee5f0f9c88203d57ba9924778bb8dd741cd5a68205136ddcc",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000062",
        "block_index": 62,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "BLDJ This time around, I ordered the TiRain 3-in-1 postpartum support [belt]. I'm sure it will be much easier than trying to wrap an ace bandage and re-adjust all day long.",
        "text_sha256": "8ec0e08a98e1bff14d957c306b5a20d93c161f4f19b50e1d8fd65130fc9058fa",
        "word_count": 31
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000063",
        "block_index": 63,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Best Postpartum Belly Band for Back and Hip Support",
        "text_sha256": "dd398fc217ccbe22495ec02a380541ff334459a806424b84acc3cfdcdd36ceda",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000064",
        "block_index": 64,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Belly Bandit 2-in-1 Hip Bandit",
        "text_sha256": "420b2436cd29013eb494a0f17dd7d5afd1e5b6986918326797a9790c835f75ed",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000065",
        "block_index": 65,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Users say it helps relieve hip and lower back pain",
        "text_sha256": "e5dfc9791f1af6ae8e88c16c185c2fb945fa0026b0a33ce95fcb102a91e36349",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000066",
        "block_index": 66,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Some users say that the fabric can curl a little after wearing it consistently",
        "text_sha256": "16ec6ef1bde642ea129f5a16b27a393888508d93a13cdd64f35aed2d331b3877",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000067",
        "block_index": 67,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Why We Love It",
        "text_sha256": "6e31e7604a2268d00ddf2594453e493aef84f8dd297f3a72433e60834fa4117b",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000068",
        "block_index": 68,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dealing with postpartum back and hip pain? The Belly Bandit 2-in-1 Bandit comes in two parts: a long band and a short band. Simply wrap the long band around your hips and layer the short band over it for extra compression. You can adjust the position of the bands to sit higher or lower on your hips — whatever feels best for you. (If you're still pregnant, it also doubles as a maternity band that wraps underneath your bump for extra support.) We also like how it’s less bulky and more discreet than some of the other options.",
        "text_sha256": "ef17114c274ad041bb8dcc3bcbaa385fad8f74322e668f6f8fdf05acffa85b89",
        "word_count": 98
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000069",
        "block_index": 69,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Sizes : XS-M (fits sizes 0-8) and L-XL (fits sizes 10-18)",
        "text_sha256": "fb0d07210fe1ec2bf8bf7cbba71856317892ed47b28f465e85d81e275bc823a7",
        "word_count": 11
